---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import AppointmentShowcase from "../components/AppointmentShowcase.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Appointment Setting Services" description="Human callers, AI voice workflows and hybrid follow-up to qualify eligible inquiries and book useful sales conversations with a clear handoff." path="/appointment-setting/">
<section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker">05 / APPOINTMENT SETTING</p><h1>Turn relevant inquiries into real conversations.</h1><p class="lf-lede">Turn more inquiries into booked conversations with human appointment setters, AI receptionists, or a hybrid of both. We design inbound call handling and permission-based outbound follow-up around your qualification rules, calendar and CRM.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your goals <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><aside class="lf-hero-aside"><span>WHY IT MATTERS</span><strong>Answer inbound calls, follow up with eligible leads and route qualified appointments to the right person.</strong><span class="lf-aside-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></aside></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted lf-setting-models" aria-labelledby="lf-setting-models-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="lf-section-head">
      <p class="section-kicker">HUMAN + AI APPOINTMENT SETTING</p>
      <h2 id="lf-setting-models-title">The right voice for every lead.</h2>
      <p>Appointment setting means actively contacting interested prospects, qualifying them, answering initial questions and booking the right next conversation. We can design that process around people, AI voice agents or a combination of both.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lf-setting-model-grid">
      <article class="lf-setting-model-card"><span class="lf-setting-model-no">01 / HUMAN CALLERS</span><h3>Personal conversations.</h3><p>Trained appointment setters call leads, learn what they need, handle initial questions and schedule qualified appointments with your team.</p><span class="lf-setting-model-tag">Human-led outreach</span></article>
      <article class="lf-setting-model-card"><span class="lf-setting-model-no">02 / AI VOICE AGENTS</span><h3>AI receptionist and voice agents.</h3><p>Handle inbound calls, answer approved FAQs, capture caller details and offer available appointment times. For eligible leads, AI agents can also make permission-based outbound follow-up calls, with disclosure and human escalation rules.</p><span class="lf-setting-model-tag">AI-assisted conversations</span></article>
      <article class="lf-setting-model-card"><span class="lf-setting-model-no">03 / HYBRID TEAM</span><h3>Automation with a human handoff.</h3><p>AI handles defined first-contact or follow-up tasks while your team takes over nuanced questions, objections and situations that need a person.</p><span class="lf-setting-model-tag">Flexible handoffs</span></article>
    </div>
    <p class="lf-setting-model-note">Calling workflows are scoped to your business, lead permissions, applicable calling and recording rules, and required human oversight. Availability and results depend on the implementation.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">THE CAPABILITIES</p><h2>What your appointment program includes.</h2></div><div class="lf-detail-grid"><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">01</span><h3>Qualification criteria</h3><p>Agree on what makes a lead relevant, including fit, intent, service area and practical requirements.</p></article>
<article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">02</span><h3>Inbound and outbound calls</h3><p>Answer new customer calls through an AI receptionist or human team, and follow up with eligible inquiries using approved scripts, consent checks and agreed retry limits.</p></article>
<article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">03</span><h3>Appointment booking</h3><p>Our setter offers available times, books qualified prospects into your calendar and records the outcome for the sales team.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-editorial-section" aria-label="What makes an appointment qualified."><div class="container"><div class="lf-editorial-head"><p class="section-kicker">BEYOND THE BOOKING</p><h2>What makes an appointment qualified.</h2></div><div class="lf-editorial-grid"><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>01 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Shared qualification rules</h3><p>Agree on service area, budget where relevant, decision-maker status, timing and disqualifying criteria.</p></article><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>02 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Human, AI or hybrid coverage</h3><p>Use people for nuanced discussions, automation for narrow repeatable steps, and explicit handoffs when questions require judgment.</p></article><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>03 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Reliable handoff and reporting</h3><p>Capture confirmed meeting details, context, no-shows, reschedules and appointment outcomes so sales can follow up intelligently.</p></article></div><p class="lf-editorial-note">We separate booked meetings from meetings actually held and from qualified opportunities. Outbound programs require a separate agreed scope and compliance checks.</p><div class="lf-editorial-actions"><a class="lf-editorial-link" href="/contact/">Discuss your requirements ↗</a><a class="lf-editorial-link" href="/our-approach/">See our approach ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted" aria-labelledby="lf-ai-reception-title"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">AI RECEPTIONIST / INBOUND + OUTBOUND</p><h2 id="lf-ai-reception-title">Never leave the next conversation to chance.</h2><p>An AI receptionist can provide a first response when your team is busy or unavailable. We design the call flow around your business, with clear boundaries, calendar availability and handoff rules.</p></div><div class="lf-detail-grid"><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">01</span><h3>Inbound call answering</h3><p>Greet callers, answer approved service questions, collect useful details and route urgent or complex requests to a person.</p></article><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">02</span><h3>Outbound lead follow-up</h3><p>Contact eligible, permissioned leads about their inquiries, ask qualifying questions and offer available booking times—without unsolicited mass calling.</p></article><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">03</span><h3>Booking and CRM handoff</h3><p>Check calendar availability, record call outcomes, create or update contact records and notify your team when human follow-up is needed.</p></article></div><p class="lf-setting-model-note">Voice automation depends on the connected telephony and booking systems. We scope availability, consent, AI disclosure, recording rules, opt-outs and escalation before launch.</p></div></section>
<AppointmentShowcase />
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">HOW WE WORK</p><h2>Clear steps.<br />Connected execution.</h2><p>Measure booked conversations, not just form submissions.</p></div><ol class="lf-process"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Define fit</h3><p>Agree on the attributes that make an inquiry worth pursuing.</p></div></li>
<li><span>02</span><div><h3>Call</h3><p>Call each eligible inbound lead promptly and introduce the service.</p></div></li>
<li><span>03</span><div><h3>Qualify</h3><p>Ask about the prospect’s needs, fit, timing and readiness; follow up on unanswered calls.</p></div></li>
<li><span>04</span><div><h3>Book and hand off</h3><p>Confirm the appointment in the client’s calendar and hand over the call notes and qualification details.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>Questions worth asking.</h2></div><div class="lf-faq-list"><details><summary>Is appointment setting included with paid ads?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. Appointment setting is an optional add-on. Its scope depends on the volume and quality of inquiries and the follow-up work required.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can your AI receptionist answer inbound calls?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes. We can design an inbound AI call workflow to answer approved questions, collect information, offer appointments and transfer or escalate calls based on agreed rules.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can AI agents call leads outbound?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Outbound AI follow-up can be configured for eligible, permissioned inquiries, subject to applicable calling rules, consent, opt-outs and appropriate human oversight. Unsolicited cold-calling is not included by default.</p></details>
<details><summary>What counts as a booked appointment?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>We define booking status, qualification requirements and reporting terms before work begins.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">CONNECTED SERVICES</p><h2>Better together.</h2></div><div class="lf-related"><a class="lf-related-link" href="/crm-automation/"><span>CRM &amp; Marketing Automation Services</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
<a class="lf-related-link" href="/performance-marketing/"><span>Performance Marketing Agency</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-end-cta"><div class="container lf-cta-inner"><div><p class="section-kicker">LET'S TALK GROWTH</p><h2>Build a more reliable path to your next customer.</h2></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
